stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> received
    received --> validating
    validating --> governance_pending
    validating --> failed: invalid command
    governance_pending --> approval_pending: approval required
    governance_pending --> scheduled: authorized
    governance_pending --> failed: denied or expired
    approval_pending --> scheduled: approved
    approval_pending --> cancelled: rejected or expired
    scheduled --> running
    running --> waiting: external or domain wait
    running --> retry_scheduled: retryable failure
    running --> compensating: forward failure
    running --> succeeded: all steps complete
    waiting --> running: signal or timer
    waiting --> retry_scheduled: retryable timeout
    retry_scheduled --> running: backoff elapsed
    retry_scheduled --> failed: attempts exhausted
    compensating --> compensated: compensation complete
    compensating --> manual_intervention_required: compensation failed
    running --> cancelled: authorized cancellation
    running --> manual_intervention_required: unsafe or uncertain state
    failed --> [*]
    succeeded --> [*]
    compensated --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    manual_intervention_required --> [*]
